'''Red Cyclone''' (レッドサイクロン, ''Reddo Saikuron'', '''Red Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] introduced in [[Attack on R-Cyclone (Expert)|Crimson Catastrophe]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

