==Trivia==
*Originally, Red Cyclone was spawned much closer to its base; the cats that attacked the base would not be harmed. As of [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]], Red Cyclone is spawned further from its base.
*Even though they were introduced around the same time, Red Cyclone has several unrelated enemies' IDs between it and [[White Cyclone]]: [[Lione Hippoe]], [[Lucky Sloth]], [[Bears Be Bare]] and [[Monkey King (Enemy)|Monkey King]].
**Furthermore, Red Cyclone is the first [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] in the [[Enemy Release Order]], but the first Cyclone Cat in the [[Cat Release Order]] is [[Bronze Cat (Rare Cat)|Bronze Cat]], which unlocks after defeating [[Dark Cyclone]].
*Red Cyclone has:
**The highest attack power of all [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]] and Cyclones.
**The fastest attack rate of all Red enemies.
**The third-highest attack power of all [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemies]], with [[Filibuster Obstructa]] and [[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]] in second and first place respectively.
**The second-highest DPS of all enemies, beaten only by [[Teacher Cybear]].

